_internal/
VOD.RIP.app/
# Junction points that redirect build output to the H: build root, created by
# scripts/build-install.ps1: repo\dist -> H:\VOD.RIP-build\_build\dist and
# repo\build -> H:\VOD.RIP-build\_build\work (PyInstaller --distpath /
# --workpath, vite outDir). The git-visible paths dist/ and build/ above cover
# them; this note exists so nobody "fixes" a 0-byte repo/dist by committing
# through it.
# Root-level deploy from scripts/deploy-dist.mjs. On Windows this is staged to
# H:\VOD.RIP-build\_deploy; the in-repo copies would be ~1.2 GB of accident
# waiting for a 'git add -A'.
/kick-overlay/
/scripts/cookie_extension_auto_install.ps1
assets/icon.iconset/
nul

